<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela sells Hotel Balla Vista for $15.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Venezuela sells Hotel Balla Vista for $15.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's National Investment Fund (FIV) sold at auction the four star Hotel Bella Vista for $15.7 million to a consortium of Venezuelan investors, the FIV said.</p>
<p>The group, which gathers investors from Venezuela's Margarita Island into a group called the Foundation for the Purchase of Hotel Bella Vista, was the only bidder for the hotel.</p>
<p>The Bella Vista Hotel on Margarita Island counts 289 rooms, 16 suites, swimming pools, restaurants and commercial areas.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
